{"seq":3,"slug":"state-machine-implementation","title":"状态机实现策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/fundamentals/state-machine-implementation","wordCount":940,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态机实现策略\">状态机实现策略</h1><p>相同的状态机逻辑可以用多种编码方式实现，每种方式的可读性、可扩展性和性能特征各不相同。本文对比四种主流实现策略——switch-case、State Pattern、表驱动和协程式——帮助你在不同项目阶段选择最合适的方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态机的实现策略决定了代码的可维护性、可扩展性和运行性能。四种主流策略分别是：switch-case（简单直接）、State Pattern（面向对象封装）、表驱动（数据与逻辑分离）、协程式（时序自然流淌）。选择策略的核心依据是状态数量、扩展需求和时序复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种策略总览\">四种策略总览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>代码量</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>switch-case</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>状态 ≤5、逻辑简单、原型阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>State Pattern</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>状态 5-15、逻辑复杂、需要扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表驱动</td>\n<td>多（初始）</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>状态多、需要运行时配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协程式</td>\n<td>少（每状态）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>异步逻辑、动画时序、对话系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"switch-case-策略\">switch-case 策略</h2><p>最直接的实现方式，用枚举表示状态，用 switch-case 处理每个状态的逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class EnemyAI : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private enum EnemyState { Patrol, Alert, Chase, Attack, Dead }&#10;    private EnemyState state = EnemyState.Patrol;&#10;    private float stateTimer;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        stateTimer += Time.deltaTime;&#10;&#10;        switch (state)&#10;        {&#10;            case EnemyState.Patrol:&#10;                MoveAlongPath();&#10;                if (CanSeePlayer())&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Alert);&#10;                break;&#10;&#10;            case EnemyState.Alert:&#10;                LookAroundAnimation();&#10;                if (CanSeePlayer())&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Chase);&#10;                else if (stateTimer &gt; 3f)&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Patrol);&#10;                break;&#10;&#10;            case EnemyState.Chase:&#10;                ChasePlayer();&#10;                if (IsInAttackRange())&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Attack);&#10;                else if (!CanSeePlayer() &amp;&amp; stateTimer &gt; 5f)&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Alert);&#10;                break;&#10;&#10;            case EnemyState.Attack:&#10;                AttackPlayer();&#10;                if (!IsInAttackRange())&#10;                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Chase);&#10;                break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void TransitionTo(EnemyState newState)&#10;    {&#10;        // OnExit 逻辑&#10;        switch (state)&#10;        {&#10;            case EnemyState.Chase: StopChaseSound(); break;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        state = newState;&#10;        stateTimer = 0f;&#10;&#10;        // OnEnter 逻辑&#10;        switch (newState)&#10;        {&#10;            case EnemyState.Alert: PlayAlertSound(); break;&#10;            case EnemyState.Chase: StartChaseMusic(); break;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class EnemyAI : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private enum EnemyState { Patrol, Alert, Chase, Attack, Dead }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private EnemyState state = EnemyState.Patrol;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float stateTimer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stateTimer += Time.deltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Patrol:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                MoveAlongPath();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (CanSeePlayer())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Alert);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Alert:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                LookAroundAnimation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (CanSeePlayer())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Chase);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else if (stateTimer > 3f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Patrol);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Chase:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ChasePlayer();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (IsInAttackRange())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Attack);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else if (!CanSeePlayer() &#x26;&#x26; stateTimer > 5f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Alert);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Attack:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                AttackPlayer();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (!IsInAttackRange())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    TransitionTo(EnemyState.Chase);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void TransitionTo(EnemyState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // OnExit 逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Chase: StopChaseSound(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stateTimer = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // OnEnter 逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch (newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Alert: PlayAlertSound(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case EnemyState.Chase: StartChaseMusic(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用时机</strong>：快速 Game Jam 原型、状态数量确定不会增长的简单对象（如弹幕、拾取物）。</p>\n<p><strong>不适用时机</strong>：状态超过 5-6 个后，每增加一个状态需要修改多处 switch-case，违反开放-封闭原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"state-pattern-策略\">State Pattern 策略</h2><p>将每个状态提取为独立类，状态机仅维护当前状态引用。这是 GoF 设计模式中的 State 模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 状态接口&#10;public interface IEnemyState&#10;{&#10;    void OnEnter(EnemyController enemy);&#10;    void OnUpdate(EnemyController enemy);&#10;    void OnExit(EnemyController enemy);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 巡逻状态&#10;public class PatrolState : IEnemyState&#10;{&#10;    private int waypointIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;    public void OnEnter(EnemyController enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        enemy.NavAgent.speed = enemy.Config.PatrolSpeed;&#10;        SetNextWaypoint(enemy);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void OnUpdate(EnemyController enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        if (Vector3.Distance(enemy.transform.position,&#10;            enemy.Waypoints[waypointIndex].position) &lt; 0.5f)&#10;        {&#10;            waypointIndex = (waypointIndex + 1) % enemy.Waypoints.Length;&#10;            SetNextWaypoint(enemy);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        if (enemy.SightSensor.CanSeePlayer())&#10;            enemy.FSM.ChangeState(new AlertState());&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void OnExit(EnemyController enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        enemy.NavAgent.isStopped = false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void SetNextWaypoint(EnemyController enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        enemy.NavAgent.SetDestination(enemy.Waypoints[waypointIndex].position);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 状态机管理器&#10;public class EnemyFSM&#10;{&#10;    private IEnemyState currentState;&#10;    private EnemyController owner;&#10;&#10;    public EnemyFSM(EnemyController controller)&#10;    {&#10;        owner = controller;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Start(IEnemyState initialState)&#10;    {&#10;        currentState = initialState;&#10;        currentState.OnEnter(owner);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ChangeState(IEnemyState newState)&#10;    {&#10;        currentState?.OnExit(owner);&#10;        currentState = newState;&#10;        currentState.OnEnter(owner);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Update() =&gt; currentState?.OnUpdate(owner);&#10;&#10;    public T GetCurrentState&lt;T&gt;() where T : class, IEnemyState&#10;        =&gt; currentState as T;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public interface IEnemyState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    void OnEnter(EnemyController enemy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    void OnUpdate(EnemyController enemy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    void OnExit(EnemyController enemy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 巡逻状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PatrolState : IEnemyState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int waypointIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnEnter(EnemyController enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.NavAgent.speed = enemy.Config.PatrolSpeed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SetNextWaypoint(enemy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnUpdate(EnemyController enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Vector3.Distance(enemy.transform.position,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enemy.Waypoints[waypointIndex].position) &#x3C; 0.5f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            waypointIndex = (waypointIndex + 1) % enemy.Waypoints.Length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SetNextWaypoint(enemy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (enemy.SightSensor.CanSeePlayer())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            enemy.FSM.ChangeState(new AlertState());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnExit(EnemyController enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.NavAgent.isStopped = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void SetNextWaypoint(EnemyController enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.NavAgent.SetDestination(enemy.Waypoints[waypointIndex].position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态机管理器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class EnemyFSM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnemyState currentState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private EnemyController owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public EnemyFSM(EnemyController controller)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner = controller;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Start(IEnemyState initialState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = initialState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ChangeState(IEnemyState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState?.OnExit(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Update() => currentState?.OnUpdate(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public T GetCurrentState&#x3C;T>() where T : class, IEnemyState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => currentState as T;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优化方案：状态对象池</strong>。频繁创建 <code>new AlertState()</code> 会产生 GC 压力，可预先实例化所有状态对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class EnemyFSM&#10;{&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;Type, IEnemyState&gt; statePool;&#10;&#10;    public void Initialize(EnemyController controller)&#10;    {&#10;        statePool = new Dictionary&lt;Type, IEnemyState&gt;&#10;        {&#10;            [typeof(PatrolState)] = new PatrolState(),&#10;            [typeof(AlertState)] = new AlertState(),&#10;            [typeof(ChaseState)] = new ChaseState(),&#10;            [typeof(AttackState)] = new AttackState()&#10;        };&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void ChangeState&lt;T&gt;() where T : IEnemyState&#10;    {&#10;        currentState?.OnExit(owner);&#10;        currentState = statePool[typeof(T)];&#10;        currentState.OnEnter(owner);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class EnemyFSM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;Type, IEnemyState> statePool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Initialize(EnemyController controller)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        statePool = new Dictionary&#x3C;Type, IEnemyState></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            [typeof(PatrolState)] = new PatrolState(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            [typeof(AlertState)] = new AlertState(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            [typeof(ChaseState)] = new ChaseState(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            [typeof(AttackState)] = new AttackState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ChangeState&#x3C;T>() where T : IEnemyState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState?.OnExit(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState = statePool[typeof(T)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentState.OnEnter(owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"表驱动策略\">表驱动策略</h2><p>将状态转换关系定义为数据表，状态机执行引擎与状态定义数据分离。这种方式极易扩展，且天然支持从配置文件加载。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 转换定义&#10;public struct TransitionRule&#10;{&#10;    public string FromState;&#10;    public string ToState;&#10;    public Func&lt;EnemyBlackboard, bool&gt; Condition;&#10;    public int Priority; // 数字越大优先级越高&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 状态定义&#10;public class StateDefinition&#10;{&#10;    public string Name;&#10;    public Action&lt;EnemyBlackboard&gt; OnEnter;&#10;    public Action&lt;EnemyBlackboard&gt; OnUpdate;&#10;    public Action&lt;EnemyBlackboard&gt; OnExit;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 表驱动状态机&#10;public class TableDrivenFSM&#10;{&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, StateDefinition&gt; states&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, StateDefinition&gt;();&#10;    private List&lt;TransitionRule&gt; transitions = new List&lt;TransitionRule&gt;();&#10;    private string currentStateName;&#10;    private EnemyBlackboard blackboard;&#10;&#10;    public void AddState(StateDefinition stateDef)&#10;        =&gt; states[stateDef.Name] = stateDef;&#10;&#10;    public void AddTransition(TransitionRule rule)&#10;        =&gt; transitions.Add(rule);&#10;&#10;    public void Start(string initialState)&#10;    {&#10;        currentStateName = initialState;&#10;        states[currentStateName].OnEnter?.Invoke(blackboard);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        // 执行当前状态 OnUpdate&#10;        states[currentStateName].OnUpdate?.Invoke(blackboard);&#10;&#10;        // 按优先级检查转换&#10;        var candidates = transitions&#10;            .Where(t =&gt; t.FromState == currentStateName&#10;                        &amp;&amp; t.Condition(blackboard))&#10;            .OrderByDescending(t =&gt; t.Priority)&#10;            .FirstOrDefault();&#10;&#10;        if (candidates.ToState != null)&#10;            TransitionTo(candidates.ToState);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void TransitionTo(string newState)&#10;    {&#10;        states[currentStateName].OnExit?.Invoke(blackboard);&#10;        currentStateName = newState;&#10;        states[currentStateName].OnEnter?.Invoke(blackboard);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 转换定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public struct TransitionRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string FromState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string ToState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Func&#x3C;EnemyBlackboard, bool> Condition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int Priority; // 数字越大优先级越高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateDefinition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string Name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Action&#x3C;EnemyBlackboard> OnEnter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Action&#x3C;EnemyBlackboard> OnUpdate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Action&#x3C;EnemyBlackboard> OnExit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 表驱动状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class TableDrivenFSM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, StateDefinition> states</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, StateDefinition>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private List&#x3C;TransitionRule> transitions = new List&#x3C;TransitionRule>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private string currentStateName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private EnemyBlackboard blackboard;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AddState(StateDefinition stateDef)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => states[stateDef.Name] = stateDef;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AddTransition(TransitionRule rule)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => transitions.Add(rule);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Start(string initialState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentStateName = initialState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        states[currentStateName].OnEnter?.Invoke(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 执行当前状态 OnUpdate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        states[currentStateName].OnUpdate?.Invoke(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 按优先级检查转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var candidates = transitions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .Where(t => t.FromState == currentStateName</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        &#x26;&#x26; t.Condition(blackboard))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .OrderByDescending(t => t.Priority)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .FirstOrDefault();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (candidates.ToState != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TransitionTo(candidates.ToState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void TransitionTo(string newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        states[currentStateName].OnExit?.Invoke(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentStateName = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        states[currentStateName].OnEnter?.Invoke(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>配合 JSON 配置</strong>：转换条件中的简单布尔逻辑可以序列化为 JSON，实现配置文件驱动的状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;states&quot;: [&quot;Patrol&quot;, &quot;Alert&quot;, &quot;Chase&quot;, &quot;Attack&quot;],&#10;  &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;Patrol&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Alert&quot;, &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;CanSeePlayer&quot;, &quot;priority&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;Alert&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Chase&quot;, &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;CanSeePlayer&quot;, &quot;priority&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;Alert&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Patrol&quot;, &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;AlertTimeout&quot;, &quot;priority&quot;: 5 },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;Chase&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Attack&quot;, &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;InAttackRange&quot;, &quot;priority&quot;: 10 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"states\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Patrol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Chase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#